    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωκ-άθω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, pres. assumed
