		</span></i>: the remaining forms may be referred to an aor.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωκαθεῖν:</span></b>  Subj. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
